# PAM stack for lion-greeter autologin / timed login (spec 01 §3).
#
# Passwordless by design: a user is only permitted if an administrator
# put them in the `lion-autologin` group. The daemon fails closed when
# this stack is missing or denies — autologin never bypasses PAM policy.
# Keep this file root-owned 0644.

auth      required   pam_succeed_if.so user ingroup lion-autologin
auth      optional   pam_gnome_keyring.so
account   required   pam_succeed_if.so user ingroup lion-autologin
account   optional   pam_systemd.so
